idea: <idea-slug>
round: 1
date: YYYY-MM-DD
---

## Summary
## Proposed approach
## Concerns / open questions
## Risks
```

After each participant returns, verify the file exists:

```text
parley-deck/ideas/<idea-slug>/round-01/<agent-id>.md
```

